26
00:02:31,232 --> 00:02:38,072
DANIEL: Could the reports export straight to our BI tool? That would help

27
00:02:38,122 --> 00:02:39,220
DANIEL: a lot.

28
00:02:39,270 --> 00:02:46,110
Bad Wi-Fi doesn't cost you the call either. The Mac app writes

29
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:52,1000
the audio to disk from the first second and finishes the upload

30
00:02:53,050 --> 00:02:59,889
when you're back online. Calls in the browser? The Chrome extension records

31
00:02:59,939 --> 00:03:06,779
the tab. Prefer a bot? Paste a Zoom, Meet or Teams link

32
00:03:06,829 --> 00:03:09,650
and it joins for you.

33
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:19,758
When the call ends, Lynkk stops on its own and saves.

34
00:03:19,808 --> 00:03:30,130
Then the Meeting Brief. Key takeaways, decisions, open questions, and action items

35
00:03:30,180 --> 00:03:40,502
with an owner, a due date and a priority. Every timestamp plays

36
00:03:40,552 --> 00:03:44,824
the recording from that moment.

37
00:03:44,874 --> 00:03:55,196
On Pro, Summary Shapes rewrite the note for the kind of meeting

38
00:03:55,246 --> 00:04:05,568
it was. There's one for sales calls, and every version is kept.

39
00:04:05,618 --> 00:04:15,940
The summary is emailed to you after every meeting, and to the

40
00:04:15,990 --> 00:04:25,448
attendees if you turn that on. That's the recap, already sent.

41
00:04:25,498 --> 00:04:35,820
Tasks land on a board. And the feature request Daniel mentioned? Send

42
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:46,193
it to Jira from the note, one issue per action item, in

43
00:04:46,243 --> 00:04:49,650
the project you pick.

44
00:04:50,300 --> 00:05:06,900
Ask Lynkk can also act for you, always behind a confirm card.

45
00:05:06,950 --> 00:05:23,550
Ask what's still open, then book the check-in: a Google Calendar event

46
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:34,650
with a Meet link, created when you confirm.

47
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:43,855
Recordings are private to your account, and Lynkk never trains on your

48
00:05:43,905 --> 00:05:52,460
conversations. Sales teams can share a workspace of up to 10 seats

49
00:05:52,510 --> 00:06:01,065
where everyone gets Pro, and any note can be marked Personal so

50
00:06:01,115 --> 00:06:04,650
only you can open it.

51
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:11,615
That's the whole sales call in Lynkk: a briefing before it, a

52
00:06:11,665 --> 00:06:17,980
recording with no bot during it, and the brief, the tasks and

53
00:06:18,030 --> 00:06:24,346
the next meeting after it. Lynkk is free to start, and the

54
00:06:24,396 --> 00:06:29,650
Mac app is free to install. Start free at lynkk.ai.
